OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FPersistent rain with heavy
OL,6,Fspells, mainly for Devon and Cornwall,
OL,7,Fwhich could lead to flooding and
OL,8,Fdisruption. Drying up towards Somerset
OL,9,Fand Dorset, but cold and cloudy.
OL,10,FBreezy inland and strong coastal
OL,11,Fwinds, adding to the unpleasant, cold
OL,12,Ffeel.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FThe rain and wind will ease
OL,15,Fthrough the night, though a brisk
OL,16,Fbreeze will remain for the north
OL,17,FCornwall coast and some light rain
OL,18,Fstill for Devon. Feeling cold.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
