OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FCold and cloudy in the morning
OL,6,Fwith light patches of rain for Dorset
OL,7,Fand Somerset. During the afternoon it
OL,8,Fwill become breezy, and further rain
OL,9,Fwill arrive in the southwest.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FWet
OL,12,Fand windy during Tuesday with heavy
OL,13,Fburst and gales, mainly over hills.
OL,14,FRain and wind easing throughout
OL,15,FWednesday and Thursday but still cold
OL,16,Fand cloudy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
